/p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm so fuckin' cool like Seth Cohen</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm so fuckin' cool[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">For thе record (Mmh-mmh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just want you to know (Huh?), I'm a sensitive soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In a heartbreaker world</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Go slow, go slow, go slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In a heartbreaker world</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Always early to the party</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sayin', "Sorry is just something that I can't control</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm buried in the corner, ever lonely"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wishin' I could be</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Seth Cohen</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're up all night with the king of self loathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I make self deprecation look so boring</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The killer of romance</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's talk about our feelings, talk about our feelings</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Seth Cohen</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm so fuckin' cool like Seth Cohen</p></div></body></tt>